1
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:30,000
"Tamed"

2
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:37,800
(Episode 6: That Annoying Doorbell)

3
00:01:41,420 --> 00:01:42,420
Lin Qi.

4
00:01:53,519 --> 00:01:54,519
Lin Qi.

5
00:02:24,573 --> 00:02:26,640
[Countdown: 1 day]

6
00:02:37,439 --> 00:02:38,240
Lawyer Cheng.

7
00:02:38,241 --> 00:02:39,279
I've emailed you the materials

8
00:02:39,280 --> 00:02:40,199
for tomorrow morning's meeting.

9
00:02:40,200 --> 00:02:41,240
Please get them confirmed.

10
00:02:41,319 --> 00:02:42,319
Cancel it.

11
00:02:49,420 --> 00:02:52,026
[We're almost out of milk!]

12
00:02:54,960 --> 00:02:56,460
Cheng Yu'an.

13
00:02:57,020 --> 00:02:58,360
What did you do?

14
00:03:05,616 --> 00:03:07,509
[Unknown number]

15
00:03:10,503 --> 00:03:11,963
[Unknown Number]

16
00:03:21,756 --> 00:03:23,583
[Cheng Yuze
"Where are you?"]

17
00:03:23,879 --> 00:03:25,139
Shen Mo.

18
00:03:25,599 --> 00:03:27,139
I tore my vocal cords the other day.

19
00:03:27,400 --> 00:03:28,680
The doctor told me not to speak.

20
00:03:29,599 --> 00:03:31,360
But a birthday only comes once a year.

21
00:03:32,120 --> 00:03:33,120
You know how it is.

22
00:03:33,620 --> 00:03:34,719
I sent you the address.

23
00:03:35,199 --> 00:03:36,199
Please come.

24
00:03:36,439 --> 00:03:37,439
I want to see you.

25
00:03:37,800 --> 00:03:39,000
That's my birthday wish.

26
00:03:40,300 --> 00:03:41,415
You don't have to stay long.

27
00:03:41,439 --> 00:03:42,439
Just let me see you.

28
00:03:42,719 --> 00:03:43,719
OK?

29
00:03:46,599 --> 00:03:48,360
If they're torn, stop talking.

30
00:03:53,699 --> 00:03:55,060
Get some rest.

31
00:04:07,836 --> 00:04:08,896
[Xu Jianian: Older Brother]

32
00:04:15,639 --> 00:04:22,318
Happy birthday.

33
00:04:22,319 --> 00:04:23,160
Drink up.

34
00:04:23,300 --> 00:04:24,300
Come on.

35
00:04:24,660 --> 00:04:25,040
Come on.

36
00:04:25,040 --> 00:04:25,600
Drink.

37
00:04:25,600 --> 00:04:26,079
Drink up.

38
00:04:26,079 --> 00:04:27,000
Look, he's not drinking.

39
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:28,000
Look at that.

40
00:04:30,079 --> 00:04:31,180
Chug it!

41
00:04:32,199 --> 00:04:33,199
Come on.

42
00:04:34,899 --> 00:04:35,899
That one's good, too.

43
00:04:44,360 --> 00:04:45,360
You came.

44
00:04:47,639 --> 00:04:48,480
I was passing by.

45
00:04:48,480 --> 00:04:49,480
So I dropped in.

46
00:04:50,699 --> 00:04:51,779
Happy birthday.

47
00:04:52,519 --> 00:04:53,519
Cake.

48
00:04:54,079 --> 00:04:55,240
Mango.

49
00:04:55,300 --> 00:04:56,419
I wasn't sure you'd like it.

50
00:04:56,420 --> 00:04:58,060
If you bought it, I'll like it.

51
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:06,759
Make a wish.

52
00:05:07,040 --> 00:05:08,240
I made one this afternoon.

53
00:05:10,579 --> 00:05:11,519
OK.

54
00:05:11,519 --> 00:05:11,920
Let's cut it.

55
00:05:11,920 --> 00:05:12,920
Go ahead.

56
00:05:15,259 --> 00:05:16,259
Mango.

57
00:05:16,459 --> 00:05:18,179
Cheng Yuze, since when do you like mangoes?

58
00:05:18,439 --> 00:05:19,639
I like them now.

59
00:05:31,259 --> 00:05:32,259
Here.

60
00:05:35,920 --> 00:05:36,920
Delicious.

61
00:05:58,399 --> 00:05:59,579
I'll use the restroom.

62
00:06:10,480 --> 00:06:12,458
Xiao Ze's retching in the restroom.

63
00:06:12,459 --> 00:06:13,579
Not sure why.

64
00:06:13,720 --> 00:06:14,720
Retching?

65
00:06:30,600 --> 00:06:31,480
What are you doing here?

66
00:06:31,480 --> 00:06:32,480
What's wrong?

67
00:06:32,759 --> 00:06:33,759
I'm fine.

68
00:06:35,339 --> 00:06:36,519
Just ate too much.

69
00:06:37,920 --> 00:06:38,920
Cheng Yuze.

70
00:06:47,339 --> 00:06:48,659
I'm a little allergic to mangoes.

71
00:06:49,519 --> 00:06:52,100
I was hospitalized for it as a kid.

72
00:06:52,399 --> 00:06:53,680
I'll be fine once I throw up.

73
00:06:55,040 --> 00:06:56,040
It's not serious.

74
00:06:57,399 --> 00:06:59,579
You knew you were allergic!
Why did you eat it?

75
00:07:03,079 --> 00:07:04,079
Because you bought it.

76
00:07:05,199 --> 00:07:06,720
My wish came true.

77
00:07:07,120 --> 00:07:09,480
How could I refuse what you brought?

78
00:07:09,759 --> 00:07:11,079
What were you thinking?

79
00:07:19,180 --> 00:07:20,339
I'll get you some medicine.

80
00:07:21,019 --> 00:07:22,019
Don't go.

81
00:07:23,920 --> 00:07:25,439
You said, "We're done."

82
00:07:26,939 --> 00:07:28,319
Yet you still came.

83
00:07:29,800 --> 00:07:31,160
I want to know.

84
00:07:31,680 --> 00:07:33,800
If I hadn't torn my vocal cords,

85
00:07:35,560 --> 00:07:36,839
would you still have come?

86
00:07:42,139 --> 00:07:42,939
[City hospital]
Mr. Lin.

87
00:07:43,060 --> 00:07:44,576
It's time for the
caregivers to change shifts.

88
00:07:44,600 --> 00:07:45,379
Oh, by the way.

89
00:07:45,380 --> 00:07:47,300
I think someone's waiting
for you in the garden.

90
00:07:56,620 --> 00:07:57,620
Lin Qi.

91
00:08:02,439 --> 00:08:03,060
Lin Qi.

92
00:08:03,060 --> 00:08:04,060
Let me explain.

93
00:08:04,339 --> 00:08:06,500
Isn't Lawyer Cheng
holding a press conference?

94
00:08:07,100 --> 00:08:08,540
How do you have time to come here?

95
00:08:12,839 --> 00:08:14,120
You saw the press conference?

96
00:08:14,240 --> 00:08:16,160
Did you want me to see it, Lawyer Cheng?

97
00:08:17,879 --> 00:08:18,879
Lin Qi.

98
00:08:19,800 --> 00:08:21,160
Don't look at me like that.

99
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:25,279
It's not what you think.

100
00:08:25,660 --> 00:08:26,639
It's not what you think.

101
00:08:26,640 --> 00:08:28,400
That painting... I was
trying to protect it.

102
00:08:29,100 --> 00:08:31,079
Is that how you protect it?

103
00:08:31,819 --> 00:08:33,519
In front of the entire nation's media?

104
00:08:34,799 --> 00:08:36,720
Using it as a bargaining chip?

105
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:38,519
It wasn't a bargaining chip.

106
00:08:39,480 --> 00:08:40,980
If Cheng Group collapses,

107
00:08:41,620 --> 00:08:43,239
the painting will be
seized and auctioned off,

108
00:08:43,240 --> 00:08:44,679
and treated as stolen property.

109
00:08:45,639 --> 00:08:46,899
If I hadn't said that,

110
00:08:47,500 --> 00:08:48,620
it would have been lost.

111
00:08:54,340 --> 00:08:55,340
Don't go.

112
00:08:55,879 --> 00:08:56,960
Cheng Yu'an, you...

113
00:08:57,779 --> 00:08:59,340
I wanted to tell you last night.

114
00:09:00,460 --> 00:09:02,379
The PR department called at 3 a.m.

115
00:09:02,659 --> 00:09:03,878
I called you dozens of times.

116
00:09:03,879 --> 00:09:04,879
Your phone was off.

117
00:09:06,360 --> 00:09:07,360
Lin Qi.

118
00:09:07,840 --> 00:09:09,059
That's when I thought,

119
00:09:10,580 --> 00:09:11,580
"I'm done for."

120
00:09:16,000 --> 00:09:17,559
Then what was all that yesterday?

121
00:09:18,080 --> 00:09:19,179
It was real!

122
00:09:19,759 --> 00:09:22,340
Everything last night was real.

123
00:09:24,659 --> 00:09:27,299
Yesterday you kissed me
like nothing was wrong.

124
00:09:27,820 --> 00:09:30,178
This morning, you used
me and my dad's painting

125
00:09:30,179 --> 00:09:31,740
as bargaining chips.

126
00:09:32,919 --> 00:09:33,960
Cheng Yu'an.

127
00:09:34,580 --> 00:09:35,500
No.

128
00:09:35,501 --> 00:09:36,759
It's not what you think.

129
00:09:40,320 --> 00:09:43,278
I feel like an outsider you shut out.

130
00:09:43,279 --> 00:09:44,759
Like I don't belong.

131
00:09:51,600 --> 00:09:52,600
Lin Qi.

132
00:09:53,299 --> 00:09:54,659
I love you.

133
00:09:55,659 --> 00:09:57,919
I'm hopelessly in love with you.

134
00:09:59,960 --> 00:10:01,000
Don't go.

135
00:10:01,860 --> 00:10:03,399
Please?

136
00:10:13,799 --> 00:10:14,799
Without you,

137
00:10:15,759 --> 00:10:16,759
that house

138
00:10:17,899 --> 00:10:19,039
is just an empty shell.

139
00:10:41,559 --> 00:10:42,559
Then from now on,

140
00:10:43,740 --> 00:10:45,240
tell me everything.

141
00:10:46,100 --> 00:10:47,100
OK.

142
00:10:47,820 --> 00:10:48,860
No matter how hard it is.

143
00:10:49,620 --> 00:10:50,620
OK.

144
00:10:51,080 --> 00:10:53,120
If you ever do this again,

145
00:10:53,740 --> 00:10:54,899
I'll never...

146
00:11:45,320 --> 00:11:46,879
You had so much to say in the garden.

147
00:11:47,899 --> 00:11:49,600
Why so quiet now?

148
00:11:50,539 --> 00:11:51,539
I'm not!

149
00:12:02,600 --> 00:12:04,320
Is that a floral scent on you?

150
00:12:05,580 --> 00:12:06,700
Smells so nice.

151
00:12:18,220 --> 00:12:19,460
Tonight,

152
00:12:19,820 --> 00:12:21,139
it's time to pay rent.

153
00:12:21,200 --> 00:12:22,059
Cheng Yu'an, don't...

154
00:12:22,179 --> 00:12:23,179
Don't what?

155
00:12:24,100 --> 00:12:25,100
Someone's coming.

156
00:12:25,259 --> 00:12:26,259
Ignore him.

157
00:12:30,559 --> 00:12:32,240
You just won't go away.

158
00:12:51,240 --> 00:12:52,240
Wait till I get back.

159
00:13:09,879 --> 00:13:10,820
Bro Ze.

160
00:13:10,821 --> 00:13:11,981
Should we go to the hospital?

161
00:13:13,960 --> 00:13:14,720
No need.

162
00:13:14,759 --> 00:13:15,759
Go back.

163
00:13:16,419 --> 00:13:18,539
Just let everyone know I'm retching.

164
00:13:19,460 --> 00:13:20,220
I don't get it.

165
00:13:20,221 --> 00:13:21,638
Your job is

166
00:13:21,639 --> 00:13:23,139
to make sure Shen Mo comes here.

167
00:13:24,600 --> 00:13:25,799
I said go, so go.

168
00:13:29,000 --> 00:13:31,000
(Next Episode)

169
00:13:36,519 --> 00:13:37,919
There's someone in the living room.

170
00:13:39,059 --> 00:13:40,059
Dad.

171
00:13:40,139 --> 00:13:41,179
Let's talk calmly.

172
00:13:41,419 --> 00:13:42,659
Slap him now,

173
00:13:43,039 --> 00:13:44,759
and the cut by his mouth will reopen.

174
00:13:45,240 --> 00:13:45,919
You again.

175
00:13:46,039 --> 00:13:48,519
You hit Lin Qi last time too,

176
00:13:48,720 --> 00:13:49,720
didn't you?

177
00:14:00,340 --> 00:14:02,059
Can you promise me one thing?

178
00:14:02,379 --> 00:14:05,539
Let's not do anything dangerous anymore.

179
00:14:06,179 --> 00:14:07,179
OK?
